WEBVTT

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:37.090
Stinkin' Leaf ninjas!

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:39.030
You think you can stop us?

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:43.790
Wow, things are starting off 
pretty serious this week!

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:46.080
Can Lee's team handle this?

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:49.210
Leave it to me.

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:50.580
Leaf―

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:51.710
Eight Tri―

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:54.330
I go first!

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:55.270
No, I do!

00:01:55.270 --> 00:01:57.380
What are you two doing?!

00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:00.240
Infighting. How stupid.

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:01.670
Now's our chance, get 'em!

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:02.760
W-What?!

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:03.890
I can't move!

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.300
Shikamaru, Choji!

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:08.980
We're here to help!

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:10.900
W-What is this jutsu?

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:12.510
The Art of Me-and-My-Shadow!

00:02:12.510 --> 00:02:13.670
You're up, Choji.

00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:15.230
On it, Shikamaru!

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:18.080
Human Juggernaut!

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:19.930
Rolly, rolly, rolly, rolly, rolly, 
rolly, rolly, rolly, rolly, rolly!

00:02:19.930 --> 00:02:21.740
Rolly rolly rolly!

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:27.250
Great teamwork. 
You can tell they're best friends!

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:29.480
Best friends! Teamwork!

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:32.310
That's what youth is all about!

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:42.930
<b>Teamwork Symbolizes Youth</b>

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:47.450
BBQ

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:46.180
This is where Lee and 
his pals go to relax,

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:47.430
the Korean BBQ Hut Q!

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:53.200
So please give us some good best friend
training to help our teamwork!

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:54.850
How troublesome.

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:57.110
Can you train to be best friends?

00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:02.870
This young lady is Shikamaru's 
teammate, Ino Yamanaka.

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:05.870
Shikamaru and I...

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:07.330
...have been sharing snacks...

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:10.580
...since we were little kids.

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:12.590
<i>I brought some chips!</i>

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:14.330
<i>Oh, thank you!</i>

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:21.980
I see. So sharing food is part
of being best friends...

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:22.630
And!

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:24.250
One of the two has to get fat.

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:26.070
D-Don't call me fat!

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:27.600
I'm just big-boned!

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:30.310
Say "ah," Neji! Open up!

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:31.840
Ow, ow!

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:33.010
Knock it off, Lee!

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:34.130
That's hot!

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:34.810
It's a symbol of our being best friends!

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:36.870
And it's to improve our teamwork!

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:41.780
I wonder if it's even possible for them 
to be like Shikamaru and Choji.

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:44.570
There's one piece left.

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:45.620
Choji, it's all yours.

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:48.130
Ah, the last piece.

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:50.830
The flavor of the final bite of 
meat is the best of them all.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.060
Ah-ha!

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:56.290
So offering the last bite is also 
part of being best friends!

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:02.420
No!

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:06.310
Here, Neji, the last bite that 
symbolizes our friendship!

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:09.430
Eat this and you'll be a 
big-boned fatty like Choji!

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.640
You and me, outside, now!

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:19.270
This is a good chance to do 
teamwork drills, actually.

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:20.730
It's troublesome, though.

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:22.420
I'm raring to go!

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.030
I must be cursed...

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:27.960
It's a two-on-two tag team match.

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:31.790
If Choji and I can escape 
with this bell, we win.

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:36.070
Lee and Neji, you have to take 
it within the time limit.

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:38.980
No matter how good you 
are individually,

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:41.710
without teamwork you'll 
never get the bell.

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:45.380
Okay, commence drills!

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:48.580
What's that stance?

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:50.860
He does that when he's 
formulating a plan!

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:53.640
Shikamaru's a super genius 
with an IQ over 200.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.480
Okay, I thought of 200 strategies.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:57.900
He thinks fast!

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:01.400
Whoa, is Lee devising a plan, too?

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.790
Okay, we'll beat them up.

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:05.740
No good! His IQ's too low.

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:07.770
I'll set a trap!

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:10.740
Buy me some time, Choji.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.330
You got it, Shikamaru!

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:16.210
I've already seen how 
you two work together,

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:18.040
and two can play that game!

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.420
What?!

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:22.420
Lee's using the Art of Me-and-My-Shadow?!

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:24.420
Eyebrow Mimic Jutsu!

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:26.590
What the heck?!

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:29.930
This is an attack where I use 
the power of the eight gates...

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:32.960
...to release my body's 
limiters on my eyebrows!

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:34.100
Gross!

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:39.600
My Multi-Size Jutsu will 
rip right through this.

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:41.470
Multi-Size Jutsu!

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:43.780
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.240
What terrifying eyebrows...

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.750
Now, Neji!

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:49.050
Use the Human Juggernaut!

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.410
Fine.

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:55.560
Eight Trigrams Rotation, Human Juggernaut!

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:57.960
I'll show you!

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:03.880
Time out, time out!

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:17.140
There, my paper bomb trap is all set.

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:19.770
Now I just need to lure them over here.

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:24.820
I've predicted every move they can make. 
This'll be easy.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:33.870
E-Except that one...

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:36.470
I'm finished...

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:38.080
Lee, are you okay?!

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:41.260
Neji... that's no good...

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:42.460
It...

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.920
It needs to be more best friend-ish.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:47.290
B-Best friend-ish?

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:51.630
L-Lee! Hang in there, buddy!

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:55.260
Don't... Don't leave me all alone!

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:58.980
Stay with me! Stay with me, Lee!

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:02.300
Neji...

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:03.860
Thank you...

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.190
The time we shared together...

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:07.740
...made me so happy...

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:13.080
But I need...

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:18.310
I need to apologize to you.

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:21.670
Forget it, Lee, don't try to talk!

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:24.710
Neji, I'm so sorry.

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:27.320
At the BBQ Hut, I...

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:31.970
I ate one more piece than you.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:33.930
BBQ?!

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:50.490
You see... that huge pile of beef...

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:52.490
When he eats the last bite,

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:57.100
my time here will be up.

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:02.260
Don't say that, you have to fight!

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:04.380
And then, a miracle happened.

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:10.260
What?!

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:13.300
The last bit of meat 
stayed the whole day,

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:16.320
And the next day, and the next.

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:18.280
And the day after.

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:21.510
It's still there.

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:27.110
Is this...

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:31.570
...all a skit Neji set up 
to give Lee courage?

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:37.100
A shoehorn?!

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:42.650
I'm just not feeling the emotion 
of the two best friends.

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:44.670
It's not your style.

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:47.940
You guys aren't the type 
to be all buddy-buddy.

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:50.090
Choji and I have been friends forever.

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:53.340
You can't just imitate us.

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.750
I told you so, Lee!

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:57.930
There's no point to copying their moves!

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:01.640
A-All I did was think of a way to 
team up with you effectively!

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:04.260
That reminds me, the plans 
should be focused around me!

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:05.140
For starters...

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:07.580
No, my plans are better.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:08.060
Because...

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.020
I'm stronger than you!

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:12.230
T-They're in sync...

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:14.700
I've had enough of this.

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:16.350
Same here.

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:17.410
Only one thing to do.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:20.370
Fight for the number one slot!

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:21.340
Agreed!

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:26.170
Leaf Rising Wind!

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.380
Eight Trigrams Air Palm Combo!

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:33.660
Not bad, Neji!

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:35.630
You, too, Lee.

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.850
W-What's going on?

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:40.300
They're on the same page now?

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:44.000
Lee and Neji aren't best friends.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:46.500
They've got a different kind of
relationship than Shikamaru and Choji.

00:09:47.070 --> 00:09:49.020
They each want to earn 
the other's respect,

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:51.070
but they can work together 
when things get tough.

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:53.030
That's what rivals are!

00:09:54.430 --> 00:09:56.150
That's more like it.

00:09:56.890 --> 00:09:57.990
You can't escape!

00:09:57.990 --> 00:09:58.930
Eight Trigrams Air...

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:00.570
<i>I can't let Neji outdo me.</i>

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:01.660
Palm!

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:04.140
Jet Lee!

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:06.660
He turned it into a team attack!

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:15.610
It's a draw.

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:21.970
Fight me, Neji!

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:23.350
That's enough for one day!

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:26.310
This suits them better.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:27.920
Hey, guys.

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.980
You put up a good fight.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:33.190
I forgive you for what 
happened at the BBQ.

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.190
Who...

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:38.990
When I use the Partial Multi-Size 
Jutsu only on my eyes,

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:40.860
I can really crank up the cuteness!

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:44.660
Wow, Choji, you're like 
a fatty-of-all-trades!

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:48.000
Don't call me fat.
 I'm just big-boned!

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.590
Rolly rolly rolly rolly rolly!

00:10:49.590 --> 00:10:53.320
Neji, I bet I can endure 
this longer than you!

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:54.920
This isn't the time!

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:57.970
How troublesome.

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:01.750
Yes, it's troublesome,
but it's still friendship.

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:03.920
Friendship comes in many forms!

00:11:24.430 --> 00:11:27.280
Ninjutsu is most important to a ninja,

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:29.600
but so is intelligence.

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:33.460
Right now, they're about to 
take an intelligence test.

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:35.420
This is the test site?

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:38.200
I'm a ninja who can't use ninjutsu,

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:40.290
so I mastered martial arts.

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:42.340
But I must keep my mind sharp, too.

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:46.430
Intelligence is one's ability to think,

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:49.430
plan, and generally solve problems.

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:52.310
Being able to think 
fast is important, too.

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:56.530
I never lose in speed.

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:01.530
He's thinking in circles...

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:07.950
I feel dizzy...

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:09.660
What a low IQ...

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:25.140
<b>The Culprit is Among Us!</b>

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.290
Hello!

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:39.360
We're really taking a test here?

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:43.570
Let's look for Guy Sensei. 
He's the proctor.

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:45.030
How troublesome.

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:50.900
That scream was Guy Sensei!

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:52.250
It came from the second floor!

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:55.730
Was it this room?

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:57.710
It's locked!

00:12:58.160 --> 00:12:59.670
Eight Trigrams Air Palm Combo!

00:13:01.970 --> 00:13:04.350
Guy Sensei, wake up!

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:06.590
Who could've done this?

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:10.960
It was these two.

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:13.620
When I heard about the IQ test,

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:16.520
I thought to come here 
beforehand and set up traps.

00:13:17.240 --> 00:13:20.090
But Lee's group showed up right 
after he took out Guy Sensei,

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:21.930
so it was too late.

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:24.190
Lord Orochimaru.

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:27.260
We should stay hidden and observe.

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:31.300
He's just knocked out.

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:32.540
What's that?

00:13:34.570 --> 00:13:36.680
His dying message.

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:37.710
How troublesome.

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:41.750
Excuse me.
 Guy Sensei's just been attacked!

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:45.970
By the way, Tenten, what did
he mean by "dying message"?

00:13:47.030 --> 00:13:48.930
It's, uh, like...

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.760
That, it's like that!

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.500
Oh, I understand!

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:54.390
It's like one of those!

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:57.310
I'm home!

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:01.610
Welcome home, Lee.

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:04.820
Mommy's going to be 
working late tonight.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.470
I left you a hamburger in the fridge.

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:11.750
Eat up before you go for tutoring!

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:17.400
The note mom leaves in the dining room―

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:18.780
Wrong!

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:19.950
Wrong?

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:21.290
Like this?

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:25.510
That's "diving."

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:28.110
These punchlines are too troublesome.

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:33.470
It's a message the victim left behind
to help people identify the culprit.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:36.020
Yeah, that one!

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:38.790
So what does it mean?

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:41.020
It looks like a coiled up snake.

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:43.480
Eureka! I know who the culprit is!

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:45.190
D-Does he know it's me?

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.520
Spirals are Naruto's symbol.

00:14:47.520 --> 00:14:49.700
It must've been Naruto!

00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:58.710
Freeze, Naruto!

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:01.610
Stay back!

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:10.180
<i>It's a sad, but scary case.</i>

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:16.220
<i>Naruto, afraid of flunking the IQ test,
 attacked Guy Sensei.</i>

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:18.520
No way!

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:24.310
Naruto's team is with Kakashi Sensei 
taking their own test.

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.320
They had nothing to do with Guy Sensei.

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:28.000
I see.

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:29.490
Well, then...

00:15:30.190 --> 00:15:31.240
I was careless!

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:36.040
How could I have overlooked the clue
when it was right under my nose?

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:38.810
It was Choji!

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:50.090
Choji's cheeks have the same 
swirl that Guy Sensei drew.

00:15:51.120 --> 00:15:52.510
His motive...

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:56.720
A grudge from not getting to eat the
last piece of beef at the BBQ Hut!

00:15:56.720 --> 00:16:01.270
You were the one who stole that
last succulent bite from me!

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:04.740
It couldn't have been Choji.

00:16:04.740 --> 00:16:06.400
The room was locked,

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:10.610
and the only way in or out 
is the vent by the ceiling.

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:14.780
I see.

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:17.240
A fatty like Choji couldn't 
have squeezed through.

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:19.070
I'm not fat!

00:16:19.070 --> 00:16:20.580
I'm just big-boned!

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:24.040
Forget Choji, none of us 
could get through there.

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.410
Yeah.

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:28.750
You'd have to have a wiry, 
flexible body, like a snake.

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:29.710
Snake?

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:31.800
T-This time he must know it's me.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.690
This is quite a conundrum.

00:16:33.690 --> 00:16:36.020
It's like a crime novel.

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:37.470
I've got it.

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:41.000
There was no actual attack.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:44.730
Solving the mystery must be our IQ test!

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:47.750
Lord Orochimaru, what should we do?

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:49.270
You heard what he said.

00:16:50.350 --> 00:16:51.700
It works for me.

00:16:51.700 --> 00:16:52.650
I've got a plan.

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:56.280
Correct, Lee.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:57.240
You were brilliant!

00:16:57.600 --> 00:17:00.520
Guy Sensei, your voice sounds funny.

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:02.710
And you're talking oddly.

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:05.170
I-I caught a little cold.

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:08.630
Then who's the Guy Sensei 
passed out here?

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:11.160
That's, um... er...

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:14.590
My twin brother, he came 
to assist me today.

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:17.510
Wow, you've got a twin 
brother, Guy Sensei?

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:18.950
Indeed.

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:22.430
He works nights at a bar now,
but he's trying to be an actor.

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:24.270
My younger twin, Golden Guy.

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:27.000
Another troublesome guy.

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:30.690
If this isn't a real test, I'm leaving.

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:34.330
Shikamaru, you've been 
complaining the whole time.

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:36.010
Get serious!

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:40.980
Those unsure of themselves 
are free to quit.

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:45.550
It's time to begin my
terrifying survival IQ test.

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:48.210
Fail, and you'll wake up in hell.

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:49.960
Sounds exciting.

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:51.050
I accept the challenge!

00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:53.050
Question one!

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:08.230
I can't think of any questions.

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:11.820
<i>It's hopeless. 
Lord Orochimaru's IQ is too low.</i>

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:15.240
Say "pizza" ten times fast!

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:19.240
<i>Lord Orochimaru, that's not an IQ test!</i>

00:18:19.520 --> 00:18:21.690
That one was made for me.

00:18:21.690 --> 00:18:22.640
Here goes!

00:18:22.640 --> 00:18:25.930
Pizza, pizza, pizza, pizza, pizza,
pizza, pizza, pizza, pizza, pizza!

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:26.910
What's this?

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:27.580
Feetsa!

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:35.590
Such an impossible question...

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:39.840
<i>Good thing his IQ is about the same...</i>

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.570
Next question!

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:45.060
What kind of bread (pan) can't be 
used to make a sandwich?

00:18:45.530 --> 00:18:49.520
What the heck? This isn't an IQ test!

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:51.400
I know. It's a frying pan (furai pan).

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:57.100
Swim trunks (kai pan)!

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.910
The answer was: bread that's 
past its expiration date.

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:05.580
Ah, of course!

00:19:06.900 --> 00:19:08.960
The next one's even harder.

00:19:10.150 --> 00:19:11.220
What now?

00:19:11.220 --> 00:19:13.130
The Big Balloon Burst Game!

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:14.910
<i>Lord Orochimaru...</i>

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:17.630
<i>You've degenerated into a 
mere variety show host.</i>

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:22.050
Every incorrect answer will make
the balloon bigger and bigger.

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:25.600
You'll have a heart attack 
waiting for them to pop!

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:30.560
And what awaits the first 
person whose balloon bursts?

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:33.140
A boiling hot bath,

00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:34.730
and scalding seafood soup!

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:37.650
This IQ test is so intense!

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:40.570
No IQ test is like this!

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:42.670
Something's very, very wrong here!

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:47.750
It's troublesome, but I 
guess I'll save them.

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:51.500
Huh?

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.590
What is this?

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:55.670
My body's moving on its own!

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:57.600
Hey...

00:19:58.930 --> 00:19:59.940
Wait...

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:00.800
No...

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:02.380
No!

00:20:03.100 --> 00:20:04.800
Too hot!

00:20:05.020 --> 00:20:06.130
No, no.

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:07.450
Don't push me!

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:09.460
Don't you dare push me!

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:12.480
Too hot!

00:20:12.990 --> 00:20:15.150
No... more...

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:17.690
You!

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:18.480
I knew it!

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:20.780
How dare you trick us!

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:24.190
I suppose the jig is up.

00:20:24.190 --> 00:20:27.530
But do you really think you'll 
leave this building alive?

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:37.380
Right now, Shikamaru's genius IQ 
of 200 is firing on all cylinders.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:41.380
He's calculated 200 setups and
punchlines ahead in an instant!

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:45.510
<i>Lee sets it up by mishearing 
"building" as "pudding."</i>

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:48.230
<i>The enemy counters with a 
fancy chestnut pudding.</i>

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:52.020
<i>Neji reappears and looks through
the chestnuts with his Byakugan,</i>

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:55.190
<i>and Lee uses the Sexy Jutsu 
to add to the ridiculousness.</i>

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:59.850
<i>Next, Guy Sensei comes to and strikes
back with a Shimura style attack.</i>

00:20:59.850 --> 00:21:01.140
<i>Choji's doing something 
in the background,</i>

00:21:01.140 --> 00:21:03.100
<i>but it's not funny so no one sees.</i>

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:04.360
<i>And finally Tenten sneaks up and says,</i>

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:05.740
<i>"Guy Sensei, behind you,"
for the punchline.</i>

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:10.740
And now we wait.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:12.980
What kind of foresight 
is that supposed to be?

00:21:12.980 --> 00:21:16.320
How can you just sit and 
wait in this situation?!

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:20.960
Whoa, they showed up!

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:23.970
We'll fight with shrimp and tai!

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:26.340
I thought you used Muay Thai!

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:31.850
Mind blown.

00:21:33.490 --> 00:21:39.210
And so, Shikamaru heroically 
fought off Orochimaru.

00:21:40.260 --> 00:21:44.950
Hey, you don't have to predict 
my ending narration, too!

00:23:22.290 --> 00:23:25.500
Next week is "A Field Trip 
to the Old Capitol!"

00:23:22.290 --> 00:23:28.090
<b>A Field Trip to the Old Capitol!
Girls' Rooms and Candy Boxes!</b>

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:28.090
and "Girls' Rooms and Candy Boxes!"

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:29.910
Judging from the titles, I predict―

00:23:29.910 --> 00:23:32.680
Shikamaru, don't spoil the next episode!

00:23:32.680 --> 00:23:33.650
You sure?

00:23:33.650 --> 00:23:36.640
I was going to drop a hint that 
would solve all the problems.

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:38.640
It's more fun anticipating the unknown!

00:23:38.640 --> 00:23:40.560
Well said, Lee!

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:45.000
I'll enjoy waiting to see what 
color Sakura's pajamas are!

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:46.480
I take it back.
